          "title": "You'll want to know: मंडई",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मंडई — maṇḍaī — \"a vegetable market\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आई रोज सकाळी मंडईत जाते. āī roj sakāḷī maṇḍaīt jāte. Mother goes to the vegetable market every morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A covered market for vegetables and fruit, as in Pune."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मंडई (maṇḍaī) is a Marathi word for a covered vegetable market; its origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
